{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25931","headline":"怀尹真人 · 鲍溶","name":"怀尹真人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万里叠嶂翠，一心浮云闲。\n羽人杏花发，倚树红琼颜。\n流水杳冥外，女萝阴荫间。\n却思人间世，多恐不可还。\n青鸟飞难远，春云晴不闲。\n但恐五云车，山上复有山。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25931.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25931","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}